  "findings": [
    "Full FourierCriticalAlgebra b730 includes the twelve-point grid; efd variant ends at zero_phases_squares and is insufficient for the existing fixed representative endpoint.",
    "The only needed cubic_has_exponent lemma is an elementary wrapper around current Hadamard6.cubic_root_eq_one_or_omega. Do not import the complete CubicEndpoints/certificate closure.",
    "FourierCriticalPhysical original allCritical_monomial uses a legacy global predicate; use current checked allCriticalCarrier_of_equivalent. A current transpose adapter is still needed.",
    "Original selected-sixSkew interface goes through GlobalCornerSixSkew, which imports absent ShoulderPhaseGatePhysical and calls UnitMomentTrace. Prior audit recorded missing UnitMomentTrace. Do not count that chain as checked. Search for existing exact model/signature binding before adding only the necessary adapter.",
    "For fixed F6 identification, compare existing current fourierHadamard representative and current OAI coordinates. Do not import FourierEndpoint, FourierPilotProofBatch0000 or certify any atlas."
